# 统一行尾与文本判定：仓库内一律存 LF，检出也保持 LF（跨平台一致，避免 diff 被 CRLF 污染）
* text=auto eol=lf

*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.cjs  text eol=lf
*.ts   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf

# 二进制：不做行尾转换，diff 视作二进制
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.webp   binary
*.zip    binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db     binary
*.exe    binary